.TH PERSONALITY 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
personality \- sets the execution-domain personality; pass 0xfffffffful to query it without changing it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/personality.h>
.B int personality(unsigned long persona);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the execution-domain personality; pass 0xffffffffUL to query it without changing it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR personality (2)
